{"id":"n14331-1-7","stage":2,"title":"어느덧 · 一晃","scene":"说明与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n14331-1-7-1","ko":"시간 참 빠르지요?","zh":"时间过得真快啊。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"시간","meaning":"光阴，时光","explanation":"시간：光阴，时光","readings":[{"term":"시간","audio":"/audio/4692cef5ac69eb37bd53.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62841","senseId":"5","lemma":"시간","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"참","meaning":"真，实在，的确","explanation":"참：真，实在，的确","readings":[{"term":"참","audio":"/audio/8e09b5f4c09195e322ba.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71761","senseId":"1","lemma":"참","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"빠르지요?","meaning":"快，快速，迅速","explanation":"빠르다：快，快速，迅速；지요：礼貌地确认、提醒或表达意愿；죠 是 지요 的缩略。","readings":[{"term":"빠르다","audio":"/audio/904de91feaff572f721f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"68755","senseId":"3","lemma":"빠르다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"4692cef5ac69eb37","term":"시간","zh":"光阴，时光","audio":"/audio/4692cef5ac69eb37bd53.mp3","entryId":"62841","definition":"自然而然流逝的岁月。","pronunciation":["시간"]},{"id":"8e09b5f4c09195e3","term":"참","zh":"真，实在，的确","audio":"/audio/8e09b5f4c09195e322ba.mp3","entryId":"71761","definition":"毫不违背事实或道理，真正地。","pronunciation":["참"]},{"id":"904de91feaff572f","term":"빠르다","zh":"快，快速，迅速","audio":"/audio/904de91feaff572f721f.mp3","entryId":"68755","definition":"某事达成所用的时间短。","pronunciation":["빠르다"]}],"audio":"/audio/c23df7c54c4cd50334a3.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n14331-1-7-2","ko":"고운 얼굴로 만나서 어느덧 우리도 이렇게 늙어 버렸군요.","zh":"初见时还青春美丽，不知不觉我们也这样老了。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"고운","meaning":"美，美丽","explanation":"곱다：美，美丽；은：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"곱다","audio":"/audio/c6119276df06f05eb152.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"24959","senseId":"1","lemma":"곱다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"얼굴로","meaning":"容貌","explanation":"얼굴：容貌；로：表示方向、方式、手段、材料、身份或原因等关系。","readings":[{"term":"얼굴","audio":"/audio/886ae927b512e2e4bc7b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17183","senseId":"2","lemma":"얼굴","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"만나서","meaning":"见面，相逢","explanation":"만나다：见面，相逢；어서：连接原因与结果，或前后相接的动作。","readings":[{"term":"만나다","audio":"/audio/b1bced847edb7e2eec5e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66591","senseId":"2","lemma":"만나다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"어느덧","meaning":"一晃，转眼","explanation":"어느덧：一晃，转眼","readings":[{"term":"어느덧","audio":"/audio/5752d35ae30d534d5672.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"14331","senseId":"1","lemma":"어느덧","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"우리도","meaning":"我们，咱们","explanation":"우리：我们，咱们；도：表示“也、连……也”。","readings":[{"term":"우리","audio":"/audio/398dfa639dfd0db8f8e0.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17182","senseId":"1","lemma":"우리","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"이렇게","meaning":"这样","explanation":"이렇다：这样；게：使前面的动作或状态修饰后文，也用于 -게 되다、-게 하다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"이렇다","audio":"/audio/c2f95cfd19c5a89b2cd1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71157","senseId":"1","lemma":"이렇다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"늙어","meaning":"老，衰老","explanation":"늙다：老，衰老；어：连接后续动作或辅助表达；常与前面的词干缩合。","readings":[{"term":"늙다","audio":"/audio/45918e04c62b7a6d9c2a.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"63500","senseId":"1","lemma":"늙다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"버렸군요.","meaning":"完","explanation":"버리다：完；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；군요：对新发现或新理解的情况表示礼貌的感叹。","readings":[{"term":"버리다","audio":"/audio/51654377be6bf0a0810e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62601","senseId":"1","lemma":"버리다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"c6119276df06f05e","term":"곱다","zh":"美，美丽","audio":"/audio/c6119276df06f05eb152.mp3","entryId":"24959","definition":"样子或长相漂亮。","pronunciation":["곱ː따"]},{"id":"886ae927b512e2e4","term":"얼굴","zh":"容貌","audio":"/audio/886ae927b512e2e4bc7b.mp3","entryId":"17183","definition":"头部前面部分的整体长相或样子。","pronunciation":["얼굴"]},{"id":"b1bced847edb7e2e","term":"만나다","zh":"见面，相逢","audio":"/audio/b1bced847edb7e2eec5e.mp3","entryId":"66591","definition":"其中一人来或去，二人因而相见。","pronunciation":["만나다"]},{"id":"5752d35ae30d534d","term":"어느덧","zh":"一晃，转眼","audio":"/audio/5752d35ae30d534d5672.mp3","entryId":"14331","definition":"不知不觉间就。","pronunciation":["어느덛"]},{"id":"398dfa639dfd0db8","term":"우리","zh":"我们，咱们","audio":"/audio/398dfa639dfd0db8f8e0.mp3","entryId":"17182","definition":"说话人指代自己和听话人在内的一些人。","pronunciation":["우리"]},{"id":"c2f95cfd19c5a89b","term":"이렇다","zh":"这样","audio":"/audio/c2f95cfd19c5a89b2cd1.mp3","entryId":"71157","definition":"表示状态、样子、性质等与此相同。","pronunciation":["이러타"]},{"id":"45918e04c62b7a6d","term":"늙다","zh":"老，衰老","audio":"/audio/45918e04c62b7a6d9c2a.mp3","entryId":"63500","definition":"上了年纪。","pronunciation":["늑따"]},{"id":"51654377be6bf0a0","term":"버리다","zh":"完","audio":"/audio/51654377be6bf0a0810e.mp3","entryId":"62601","definition":"表示前面所说的行动已完全结束。","pronunciation":["버리다"]}],"audio":"/audio/0772a7b2eabac1bacfeb.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.715,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=14331","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"중급","day":89,"sequenceScore":2.4403,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["初见时还青春美丽，不知不觉我们也这样老了。","啊，怎么也赶不走困意啊。","时间过得真快啊。"],"answer":2},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["初见时还青春美丽，不知不觉我们也这样老了。","时间过得真快啊。","啊，怎么也赶不走困意啊。"],"answer":0}]}
